catflow 0.8
1. Read Text         memo.txt
2. Split             chunk_size=500
3. <each contextualize>   (2,1)
     1. Draft   (input:1)   Ministral 3B; "one sentence about this chunk"
     2. Draft   (input:2)   Ministral 3B; "one sentence about the whole
                            document"
4. Join Text   (3)   separator="---"
